  "description": "How far down do you have to fall before there’s no coming back? For Seong-Cheol, rock bottom is a cramped apartment shared with Min-Ho, a man whose \"love\" is expressed through bruises and cruel control. Just as Seong-Cheol surrenders to his grim fate, his past walks through the door in the form of Jun-Seo, a former classmate turned detective. Jun-Seo becomes obsessed with rescuing Seong-Cheol from his living hell, but breaking a toxic bond is never easy. As Min-Ho senses his prize slipping away, his possessive rage triggers a dangerous, high-stakes confrontation. Can Jun-Seo's fierce, protective devotion save Seong-Cheol, or will they all be dragged down by the heavy shadows of the past?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
